        - !<reference> 35455744-a12b-4f51-953e-38bcc8fe4d86
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Lay a palm flat on a table and hold it still until the ring around it fills. The cube lands where your hand was. In the Lens Studio preview, click instead. Drag the menu to slide the cube across the table, or pinch Reset Placement to place it again."
        - "Look at an open spot on the floor and hold your view steady until the ring fills. The cube lands there. Drag the menu to slide it across the floor, or pinch Reset Placement to place it again."
        - "Look at a clear patch of wall and hold your view steady until the ring fills. The cube lands on the wall. Drag the menu to slide it along the wall, or pinch Reset Placement to place it again."
